MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 28c3e562645bb4c13bba240885e23578, type: 3}
  m_Name: Hub_Vega_Briefing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    expression: 1
    text: "Bienvenido a Mars Crafts, comandante. Durante a\xF1os hemos estudiado
      la Tierra, la Luna y Marte, pero a\xFAn quedan muchas preguntas."
    textEn: Welcome to Mars Crafts, commander. For years we've studied the Earth,
      the Moon and Mars, but many questions remain.
    highlight: 
  - speaker: 0
    expression: 0
    text: "Hoy empieza nuestra misi\xF3n m\xE1s importante: investigar una regi\xF3n
      inspirada en el cr\xE1ter Jezero, donde la NASA encontr\xF3 evidencias de un
      antiguo lago y un delta."
    textEn: 'Today our most important mission begins: exploring a region inspired
      by Jezero crater, where NASA found evidence of an ancient lake and delta.'
    highlight: 
  - speaker: 0
    expression: 0
    text: "Nuestra pregunta cient\xEDfica: \xBFqu\xE9 podemos aprender sobre los
      antiguos ambientes con agua de Marte estudiando sus rocas?"
    textEn: 'Our science question: what can we learn about Mars''s ancient watery
      environments by studying its rocks?'
    highlight: 
  - speaker: 0
    expression: 0
    text: "All\xE1 estudiar\xE1s tres puntos: el delta, un afloramiento mineral y
      una roca especial. Cada uno necesita un instrumento distinto."
    textEn: 'There you''ll study three sites: the delta, a mineral outcrop and a
      special rock. Each one needs a different instrument.'
    highlight: 
  - speaker: 0
    expression: 0
    text: "En el taller dise\xF1ar\xE1s tu rover. Tienes 110 cr\xE9ditos, y cada
      componente suma masa: tu cohete solo puede llevar cierto peso."
    textEn: 'In the workshop you''ll design your rover. You have 110 credits, and
      every part adds mass: your rocket can only carry so much.'
    highlight: 
  - speaker: 1
    expression: 1
    text: "\xA1Y yo te ayudar\xE9, comandante! Mi \xFAltimo diagn\xF3stico dice que
      funciono casi perfectamente."
    textEn: And I'll help you, commander! My last diagnostic says I work almost perfectly.
    highlight: 
  - speaker: 0
    expression: 1
    text: "Cuando est\xE9s listo, entra al taller por la puerta del fondo. Suerte."
    textEn: When you're ready, go into the workshop through the door at the back.
      Good luck.
    highlight: 
